            {
                "entry_id": "26ea204d-3380-35bd-bd8c-fced38ad5f3f",
                "word": "ramification",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "b3ab0e4a-7f11-4fe1-905c-53be30774bbd",
                        "entry_id": "26ea204d-3380-35bd-bd8c-fced38ad5f3f",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "ramifications"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "de2918b6-2df5-37fa-ab0a-b13ba4cb12a2",
                        "entry_id": "26ea204d-3380-35bd-bd8c-fced38ad5f3f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Division en plusieurs rameaux."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0588fb54-5978-48a2-a541-acc58b569da2",
                                "sense_id": "de2918b6-2df5-37fa-ab0a-b13ba4cb12a2",
                                "text": "La ramification d’une tige, des artères des veines, des nerfs."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "226feb59-373c-3917-9ee5-c16afd1b47ea",
                        "entry_id": "26ea204d-3380-35bd-bd8c-fced38ad5f3f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Chacun des rameaux produits."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3324e6fb-201d-4c06-873c-b2ebdd284bc0",
                                "sense_id": "226feb59-373c-3917-9ee5-c16afd1b47ea",
                                "text": "Cerclée d’une triple enceinte de murailles noirâtres à créneaux, cette ville est bâtie près du cap Apchéron, sur les extrêmes ramifications de la chaîne du Caucase."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "244f2923-4679-43dc-900d-0d5bb5c0d40a",
                                "sense_id": "226feb59-373c-3917-9ee5-c16afd1b47ea",
                                "text": "Ramifications vasculaires, nerveuses."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0e8b37d9-2e85-3e7f-8aa6-bb3d73ea2054",
                        "entry_id": "26ea204d-3380-35bd-bd8c-fced38ad5f3f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Subdivisions d’une science, d’une étude."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "90c036f8-8f29-43e6-b501-da67c245a40c",
                                "sense_id": "0e8b37d9-2e85-3e7f-8aa6-bb3d73ea2054",
                                "text": "Il a étudié son sujet jusqu’aux moindres ramifications."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b0d46132-4a09-396f-ba72-383e2adcb6a2",
                        "entry_id": "26ea204d-3380-35bd-bd8c-fced38ad5f3f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Embranchement, extension d’une secte, d’un complot."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b29cddad-d1a5-480b-954d-251250cf07f5",
                                "sense_id": "b0d46132-4a09-396f-ba72-383e2adcb6a2",
                                "text": "L’association prit un accroissement rapide ; elle étendit ses ramifications jusqu’aux villages les plus reculés."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d2646388-6cc7-4574-a9e2-58e2cdaf281e",
                                "sense_id": "b0d46132-4a09-396f-ba72-383e2adcb6a2",
                                "text": "Une sérieuse contre-révolution qui se mijote de l’autre côté, mais qui, malheureusement, possède d’importantes ramifications en France…"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "85dead88-6a88-4a9b-95c8-b42b8ca71b0a",
                                "sense_id": "b0d46132-4a09-396f-ba72-383e2adcb6a2",
                                "text": "Autre donnée à prendre en compte, le montant du préjudice : 350 000 euros pour le MoDem contre plus de six millions pour le RN, dont les ramifications révélées notamment par Mediapart semblent bien plus denses que ce qui a été reproché au MoDem."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "67514b29-bfb8-35bd-815c-c38d91a09ba6",
                        "entry_id": "26ea204d-3380-35bd-bd8c-fced38ad5f3f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Branche formée par des atomes qui se distinguent par rapport à la chaîne principale."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fdf1c1bf-bc9e-45c5-a922-9ff87209133e",
                                "sense_id": "67514b29-bfb8-35bd-815c-c38d91a09ba6",
                                "text": "La molécule d’iso-octane a de nombreuses ramifications : elle est ramifiée."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a66cdd31-5774-322d-9a04-ad7d4957ee1d",
                        "entry_id": "26ea204d-3380-35bd-bd8c-fced38ad5f3f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Division d’un projet en plusieurs branches, et par métonymie, l’une de ces branches."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fd94283f-bea7-4c36-8964-e25465b6c984",
                                "sense_id": "a66cdd31-5774-322d-9a04-ad7d4957ee1d",
                                "text": "La branche 1.8 devait être créée à l’origine fin juillet mais la ramification pour la 1.8 a été retardée après qu’il est devenu évident que tout le travail nécessaire ne pourrait être terminé à temps."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6ac59f2a-d67a-469d-ae15-7fc8d316d44e",
                        "source_entry_id": "26ea204d-3380-35bd-bd8c-fced38ad5f3f",
                        "source_sense_description": "action de ramifier",
                        "target_lang_word": "Verzweigung",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Verzweigung",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ecb80eb6-204e-34b6-a626-e836e9b13cf7",
                                        "entry_id": "0ee6230e-ea7b-3127-bfd1-07a00d32c6f5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "das Sichverzweigen; Aufteilung eines (physischen oder symbolischen) Stranges in mindestens zwei Abzweige, die danach unabhängig voneinander bestehen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9c47f3ea-1a9a-4f3c-9c97-b347f838efda",
                                                "sense_id": "ecb80eb6-204e-34b6-a626-e836e9b13cf7",
                                                "text": "„Während des Längenwachstums eines Sprosses werden auch Möglichkeiten zur Verzweigung angelegt.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f92c4eb4-c1ed-42cb-9667-f73a15fe93db",
                                                "sense_id": "ecb80eb6-204e-34b6-a626-e836e9b13cf7",
                                                "text": "„Etwas später kam noch eine Verzweigung, dann eine dritte.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "09919319-b948-38a0-a3d3-fdd1d6e3a80c",
                                        "entry_id": "0ee6230e-ea7b-3127-bfd1-07a00d32c6f5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "das Verzweigen; Änderung eines Programmflusses durch eine bedingte Anweisung"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2747d496-53ba-447d-a5fb-6786d612672a",
                                                "sense_id": "09919319-b948-38a0-a3d3-fdd1d6e3a80c",
                                                "text": "„Funktionsteam A und Funktionsteam-B führen ihre jeweilige Arbeit in separaten Verzweigungen aus.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "20ac2756-0534-34cb-bd15-74d847bec264",
                                        "entry_id": "0ee6230e-ea7b-3127-bfd1-07a00d32c6f5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Kreuzung"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Swiss Standard German"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"3\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e322e3d4-2589-42f6-b758-ae9d94d7a941",
                        "source_entry_id": "26ea204d-3380-35bd-bd8c-fced38ad5f3f",
                        "source_sense_description": "action de ramifier",
                        "target_lang_word": "ramification",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ramification",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bf08bbbf-fd9c-3168-a73f-83a2382f9291",
                                        "entry_id": "a4245d96-6536-331e-9a89-8adebd1afeee",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A branching-out, the act or result of developing branches; specifically the divergence of the stem and limbs of a plant into smaller ones, or of similar developments in blood vessels, anatomical structures etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "also",
                                            "countable",
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "40a42dd8-a26d-494d-9014-b56fb699770b",
                                                "sense_id": "bf08bbbf-fd9c-3168-a73f-83a2382f9291",
                                                "text": "The character of trees may be studied to advantage […] in winter, when the forms of the ramification can be seen in the naked boughs […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "751e8f2c-2cb5-4366-a564-8980c4f94e97",
                                                "sense_id": "bf08bbbf-fd9c-3168-a73f-83a2382f9291",
                                                "text": "From the left chamber or ventricle of the strong muscular mass, the heart, a large tube arises, called the aorta; and by a continued division or ramification, opens a way for the bright scarlet blood to the very minutest part of the living frame […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "528a0127-865b-44f1-bf8e-009940e62758",
                                                "sense_id": "bf08bbbf-fd9c-3168-a73f-83a2382f9291",
                                                "text": "[…]we may be sure that Becky and Briggs looked out those august names in the Peerage, and followed the noble races up through all the ramifications of the family tree."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1cddaf53-e476-4b69-a05c-d85d9fcfaec8",
                                                "sense_id": "bf08bbbf-fd9c-3168-a73f-83a2382f9291",
                                                "text": "“You live in a different world to me, Mr. Overton—a sweeter and healthier one. My ramifications stretch out into many sections of society, but never, I am happy to say, into amateur sport, which is the best and soundest thing in England.[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "96c0e2c9-a479-42cf-a4c4-81f39bf5fe3c",
                                                "sense_id": "bf08bbbf-fd9c-3168-a73f-83a2382f9291",
                                                "text": "Quite unexpectedly an idea popped into Tarzan's head. In following out the many ramifications of the dictionary definition of God he had come upon the word create—“to cause to come into existence; to form out of nothing.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "67132de4-5d45-3d14-8fff-1614e0cba78c",
                                        "entry_id": "a4245d96-6536-331e-9a89-8adebd1afeee",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An offshoot of a decision, fact etc.; a consequence or implication, especially one which complicates a situation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "in-plural",
                                            "often",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d7521a4b-781b-497e-bdcc-3f8a7620878a",
                                                "sense_id": "67132de4-5d45-3d14-8fff-1614e0cba78c",
                                                "text": "The treachery of some of the Jacobite agents (Rashleigh among the rest), and the arrest of others, had made George the First's Government acquainted with the extensive ramifications of a conspiracy long prepared, and which at last exploded prematurely […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ab4dbfcb-28eb-4089-a5fe-59efbfb61d31",
                                                "sense_id": "67132de4-5d45-3d14-8fff-1614e0cba78c",
                                                "text": "What, then, is my Scheme? It is a very simple one, although in its ramifications and extensions it embraces the whole world."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "79f8ee90-b95e-40fe-b67c-94debbabe1a6",
                                                "sense_id": "67132de4-5d45-3d14-8fff-1614e0cba78c",
                                                "text": "He stirred up a bigger muss than he had anticipated, and even he was astounded at the wide ramifications of the struggle and at the unexpected and incongruous interests that were drawn into it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dfff8728-ac01-48ff-811b-90bb5573c4ca",
                                                "sense_id": "67132de4-5d45-3d14-8fff-1614e0cba78c",
                                                "text": "But most often and memorably his work falls into that territory best summed up as speculative fiction, with a particular emphasis on dystopian futures and the existential ramifications of space exploration."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4d25f50a-f40a-443c-9fa9-4e1551e3a5b2",
                                                "sense_id": "67132de4-5d45-3d14-8fff-1614e0cba78c",
                                                "text": "The advent of COVID passports, so soon after increased check-in bureaucracy post-Brexit, brought major logistical ramifications to St Pancras International, of a kind unseen at any other major station in Britain."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "11003956-6426-3eff-9924-e1ac56c4399f",
                                        "entry_id": "a4245d96-6536-331e-9a89-8adebd1afeee",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An arrangement of branches."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
